    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start, but it feels a bit surface-level. can you go deeper into the legal or philosophical arguments? like, what are the specific reasons people give for why it would be considered \"unjust\" to apply these claims to the present day? i want to make sure i'm not just characterizing it as people being difficult, but understanding the actual logic they use.",
